#: ../../source/docs/common-corvon743v1.rst:57
#: 0a41041e742e4e38a2ebe8f3459c2f1f 20d3c580567344d58502993f599660e3
#: 9f002e83539c4fc8bdaf0bcc13d2ddc6 d625a0c442dc4ae5b978385ae366b4d4
#: fb49bfc756ee47cfaf4b417740720007
msgid ""
"The default RC input is configured on the UART6. The SBUS pin is inverted "
"and connected to RX6. Non SBUS, single wire serial inputs can be directly "
"tied to RX6 if SBUS pin is left unconnected. RC could  be applied instead to"
" a different UART port such as UART1, UART4 or UART8, and set the protocol "
"to receive RC data ``SERIALn_PROTOCOL`` =23 and change "
":ref:`SERIAL5_PROTOCOL <SERIAL5_PROTOCOL>` to something other than '23'. For"
" RC protocols other than unidirectional, the TX6 pin will need to be used:"
msgstr ""
"默认 RC 输入配置在 UART6 上。SBUS 引脚经反相后连接到 RX6。如果 SBUS 引脚保持悬空，非 SBUS 的单线串行输入可以直接接到 "
"RX6。也可以改用其他 UART 端口（如 UART1、UART4 或 UART8）接收 RC，将其协议设置为接收 RC 数据 "
"``SERIALn_PROTOCOL`` =23，并把 :ref:`SERIAL5_PROTOCOL <SERIAL5_PROTOCOL>` 改为 "
"'23' 以外的值。对于非单向的 RC 协议，还需要使用 TX6 引脚："

